The long-running portion is the exact hard-preset verification, not search: the checker is evaluating the displayed degree-90 polynomial at 260,003 rational-circle parameters. This is expected and remains polynomial; the sampled-guess path rejects non-switch endpoints early, so it does not pay that full cost 200,000 times.
