+    "intuition_description": (
+        "Recognize that the roots of the expanded colour polynomial are a "
+        "centrally symmetric arithmetic progression; without that symmetry one "
+        "must evaluate the colour rule along the entire cyclic point order."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: Section 3.1 gives an O(N) cyclic chunk/switch scan once point "
+        "colours are explicit; for this succinct degree-18 shipping instance, "
+        "Horner evaluation makes the exact reference scan O(Nd), measured by "
+        "selftest at 4,320,396 integer arithmetic operations for N=120011, while "
