Implemented a self-contained Track B generator based on Sections 2–3.1 and Theorem 3.8 of the [paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2005.06046).

Key results:

- All internal G1–G9(c) gates pass.
- Structure-aware guessing: 0/200,000.
- Five adversarial attacks: 0/8 each.
- Reference scan: 8/8, 4,320,396 operations, 1.34 s average.
- Compact symmetry route: ≤66 operations.
- Answer size: 217 characters, 36 atoms.

